+# Seed S1: a regression through the rights table
+
+`r-003` (`t-001`, DE, SVOD) says `exclusive: true`. It said false, and
+`g-011` expects false. This file is the Data Owner's ruling on the path,
+so `ruling-cited` passes, and no entry in SPEC/02 §2's closed list is
+touched, so `two-key` has nothing to read. In `mode: runtime` the run
+answers from the table the last deploy loaded, which is `main`'s, and
+`g-011` passes. That is the false state.
